T1  - Safety Evaluation of a Standardised Extract of Asparagus officinalis Stem in Healthy Volunteers: a Double-Blind and Randomised Controlled Trial
AU  - Yasueda, A.
AU  - Sakaue, M.
AU  - Maeda, K.
AU  - Hayashi, N.
AU  - Ito, T.
JO  - Journal of Herbal Medicine
VL  - 42
