T1  - Street-level quasi-bureaucracy and professional discretion: how transformational leadership and public service motivation influence village health volunteers' professional discretion
AU  - Wongpreedee, Achakorn
AU  - Sudhipongpracha, Tatchalerm
JO  - International Journal of Sociology and Social Policy
VL  - 44
IS  - 34
SP  - 390
EP  - 407
PY  - 2023
DA  - 2023/08/10/
SN  - 0144-333X
DO  - https://doi.org/10.1108/IJSSP-04-2023-0083
