T1  - The analgesic effects and neural oscillatory mechanisms of virtual reality scenes based on distraction and mindfulness strategies in human volunteers
AU  - Li, Jingwei
AU  - Yang, Haoyu
AU  - Xiao, Yian
AU  - Liu, Xu
AU  - Ma, Bingjie
AU  - Ma, Ke
AU  - Hu, Li
AU  - Lu, Xuejing
