T1  - ‘It is successful, and if it is successful, it reduces crime, and it can make the victims happier’: volunteers’ perceptions of working in restorative justice
AU  - Kitson-Boyce, Rosie
AU  - Athwal-Kooner, Palwinder
JO  - Journal of Forensic Practice
VL  - 26
IS  - 2
SP  - 89
EP  - 99
PY  - 2024
